Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 21:27:15 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1396/1463] HERESY 1442: Qwen-Image 2.1's fine-tunes as
 brushes, and its Turbo
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 14.10.2026: «Для QW21 скачал один файнтюн в Ruach_Studio/artwork/Qwen-Image-2.1/checkpoints/… и 4step Turbo LoRA, которую можем прикрутить». An fp8 single file of artwork/Qwen-Image-2.1/checkpoints/ (FinalCut v1 the first) is a brush of 2.1 (qwen21-fp8): its fused img_mlp.gate_up split into diffusers' gate_layer and proj (the first half and the second, measured by cosine against 2.1's own: 1.00 and 0.00), fp8 on the card, each layer bf16 while it computes; in every other way it is 2.1 (its licence, edits by words, lettering). «Turbo 4step» where it lies under artwork/loras/qwen-image-2.1/ is 2.1's speed-up as Lightning is 2512's: off unless asked, 4 to 16 steps when on (Sampling names it Turbo). Measured on an RTX 3090 at 1280²: FinalCut 30 steps 96 s, with Turbo 4 steps 42 s, 16.6 GB at the peak both; Turbo reached 227 layers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
